        "51": {
            "name": "input51",
            "order": "9",
            "qid": "51",
            "text": "<p>After the euthanasia when your pet has passed, you may elect to care for your pet on your own. We also provide cremation services, either with the return of ashes (\"Private Cremation\") and without the return of ashes. Private cremations come with a beautiful solid wood urn and customized nameplate. If you choose not to receive your pet's ashes back, they will be given a burial at sea, where they, along with other beloved pet cremains, will be <a href=\"https://www.vetatyourdoor.com/memorial-reef\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">added to a Memorial Reef Sphere</a> and placed on the ocean floor to stimulate coral reef production.</p>",
